{{smaller block|Unto the ''angel'' of the church in Smyrna write. {{right|Rev. ii. 8.}}}}
'''3.''' A messenger. [Poetical.]
{{smaller block|<poem>The dear good ''angel'' of the Spring,
The nightingale. ''B. Jonson'', Sad Shepherd, ii. 2.

The God who knew my wrongs, and made
Our speedy act the ''angel'' of his wrath,
